  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shachar_avaqeshkha_gabirol" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n40.jpg">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="stanza" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shachar_avaqeshkha_gabirol_39123/1"/>In the morning I seek Thee, my rock and my fortress. I order my morning and also my evening prayer before Thee. <tei:milestone unit="stanza" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shachar_avaqeshkha_gabirol_39123/2"/>Before Thy grandeur I stand and tremble, for Thine eye sees all the thoughts of my heart. <tei:milestone unit="stanza" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shachar_avaqeshkha_gabirol_39123/3"/>What can heart and tongue accomplish, what can my strength, what can the spirit within me. <tei:milestone unit="stanza" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:shachar_avaqeshkha_gabirol_39123/4"/>Behold, man’s song pleases Thee. Therefore, I wish to thank Thee as long as God’s breath is in me. <tei:milestone unit="stanza"/></tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
  </tei:text>
